<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-ef4b5d9f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<h3 class="wp-block-heading is-style-x-small is-style-x-small--11"><a href="/financial-aid/">Financial Aid Information</a></h3>



<p class="is-style-small is-style-small--12 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:0">Explore your financing options at Cleveland Community College, including grants, scholarships, work-study, and more — all designed to help you fund your education and reach your goals.</p>
</div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group mega-menu-item__dropdown-card is-vertical is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2fa68af8 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
