<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-ef4b5d9f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<h3 class="wp-block-heading is-style-x-small is-style-x-small--13"><a href="/admissions/">How To Apply</a></h3>



<p class="is-style-small is-style-small--14 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:0">Dream bigger with Cleveland Community College! From degrees to diplomas to certificates, CCC gives you the tools and confidence to shape your career and your future. Let’s get started.</p>
</div>
