<p class="has-text-align-left is-style-default has-balanced-text wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)">The CCC Foundation was established in 1983 as a not-for-profit corporation to ensure quality education and financial stability for CCC. The highly successful, multimillion-dollar effort by the Foundation has so far expanded CCC&#8217;s footprint in both physical assets and training options. It has also connected Cleveland County&#8217;s economic development efforts to the workforce training taking place at CCC.</p>



